cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this research note when using the theorem or formalization."
title: "Unbounded coalesced-mass certificates for resolution trees"
authors:
  - family-names: Goyal
    given-names: Dev D.
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  The coalesced dyadic clause-mass functional on unrestricted finite ordinary
  resolution refutations of the full signed-clause formula has exact supremum
  n+1 for every n at least 3. External source identity and historical priority
  are not certified.
preferred-citation:
